{"id":"steam-1188400","steam":1188400,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"WARRIOR SPIRIT","summary":"An innovative 3D Action-Adventure Platformer unlike anything else. Combine WARRIOR SPIRIT’s four Arms of Good with clay to swing, bounce, wall-run and dash through various lands, defeating evil and serving the will of Good.","about":"WARRIOR SPIRIT™ is an innovative single-player 3D Action-Adventure Platformer unlike anything else. \r\n\nPlay as a Clay Machine created to destroy evil clay monsters. Combine the four Arms of Good with a diverse set of clay materials to swing, bounce, wall-run and dash through the four corners of the land, each a giant area to explore.  \n\nIt is your charge to bring the will of Good to bear against the monsters of evil and use unique tools to pinch, smash and slice your way to victory.  \n\nChoose your style, with multiple paths through levels; using motion to speed to the exit, or take time to explore the many puzzles of the world, and collect sand dollars to spend on additional clay items.  \r\n\nThe Tools of WARRIOR SPIRIT.\n\nWARRIOR SPIRIT’s Helmet of Good provides multiple Arms, each with their own unique moves and tools. \r\n\n• \nThe White Arm can grab all sorts of things, like clay to bounce, swing, and climb. \r\n\n• \nThe Red Arm wields The Cutter of Good, which slices clay. \r\n\n• \nThe Blue Arm holds The Needle of Good, which pinches clay. \r\n\n• \nThe Yellow Arm commands The Mallet of Good, which smashes clay.\n\nDefeat the monsters of evil. \n\nThe monsters are running amok across the land. Each unique type has its own weakness to the different Arms of Good. Defeating them can leave you with useful clay tools. \r\n\nMaster your environment.\n\nWARRIOR SPIRIT can use the particular properties of clay to traverse the world and solve puzzles.  \r\n\n• \nBounce clay reaches higher heights.  \r\n\n• \nHard clay provides a platform for scaling walls. \r\n\n• \nSticky clay can swing away from danger.  \r\n\n• \nLife clay restores valuable life.\n\nFeatures\n\n• \nHuge open world – Four unique corners of the world to explore. From the glass-ridden desert, to the schoolhouse jungle – the opulent sea tower, to the factory of clay. \r\n\n• \nPlay your way – Test your skills and dash for the objective, or take a step back and survey the many puzzle platformer challenges across the world. \r\n\n• \nNever blame your tools – Zoom over bodies of water, bounce up ledges, swing from vines or speed across walls with the traversal tools at your disposal. \r\n\n• \nGo toe-to-toe – Test your combat skills and wield the Arms of Good against a host of evil monsters, each with different strengths and weaknesses.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/16abeb7f89c0ffba89ff8395df817b4ebc245f30/library_capsule.jpg?t=1765367320","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/400ebef9c255ab63e554f37a110f1ee72a4f1012/header.jpg?t=1765367320","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/22da349248869a97f88720f846d38bcfe0e20ea2/library_hero.jpg?t=1765367320","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/400ebef9c255ab63e554f37a110f1ee72a4f1012/header.jpg?t=1765367320","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1765367320","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/3ec3551c09345dfab7ab151d4b678f5411262d90/ss_3ec3551c09345dfab7ab151d4b678f5411262d90.600x338.jpg?t=1765367320","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/3ec3551c09345dfab7ab151d4b678f5411262d90/ss_3ec3551c09345dfab7ab151d4b678f5411262d90.jpg?t=1765367320"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188400/8c159017b918f49377b4a0936611d3781b53e1e0/ss_8c159017b918f49377b4a0936611d3781b53